 "applies_to": "YORK scroll chillers, heat pumps and condensing units (board 031-02550, including YCWL and YLAE variants named on the sheet), connected through a YORK E-Link gateway over YorkTalk 2.",
 "summary": "The E-Link gateway reads the scroll unit board over YorkTalk 2 (4800 baud) and serves BACnet, N2, LON and Modbus objects named by YorkTalk page: remote setpoint, load limit, heat pump mode and start/stop, liquid and refrigerant temperatures and pressures per system, run hours and status codes.",
 "bacnet_transport": [],
 "firmware": null,
 "default_device_instance": null,
 "access_inferred": false,
 "notes": [
  "This is a YorkTalk 2 E-Link sheet; objects are named by YorkTalk page (YT2_S01_P03 and so on), and only populated slots not marked unavailable on every version are listed.",
  "Access follows the sheet's Modbus function note: the remote slots AV 1-4 and BV 1-4 accept writes; the rest are read-only.",
  "Multistate states are shown as printed (from 0); this sheet does not say whether the BACnet value adds 1, so confirm by discovery (read the state text).",
  "Several remote slots carry alternative meanings by unit type (standard, DAT unit, SP unit, heat pump); they are shown joined with \"/\"."
 ],
